# Witness: pointers written through an explicit path are nulled by zero; a nulled pointer to a Structure prints `@: p 0` (seen 1).
# Norm: the book #scope («присваиваются только друг другу и обнуляются»), journal 2026-11-17 #l3-own-types; R51 Q3.
# Slice C2 (plan #one-graph-plan, P1): the check lives in src/l2src/lmx_checks.lm2.
(
    Observed:
        int: seen 0
        @: p 0
        @: q int
)
@: shared data[0]
sub: main () (A(int: v 1); int: x 5)
    shared\Observed\p := A
    shared\Observed\p := 0
    shared\Observed\q := @x
    shared\Observed\q := 0
    shared\Observed\seen := 1
main()
